{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>《美食新聞報道》精彩內容源源不絕！首站由蕭欣浩博士帶領蔡景行（行仔）造訪集京菜與淮揚菜精髓於一身的帝苑酒店「東來順」，體驗專為盛夏轉初秋而設的滋潤藥膳菜單；第二站則由「掃街戰士」陳若思與倪嘉雯深入熱鬧的油麻地街頭，大肆開箱多款話題度極高的創新平民小食！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_1e6771c69b172611-1773\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>蕭欣浩博士與行仔造訪位於尖沙咀帝苑酒店的東來順，品嚐融匯京淮精髓的滋養藥膳（溫馨提示：藥膳套餐必須提早至少一天預訂）：</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li></ul><p id=\"p-rc_1e6771c69b172611-1777\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>東來順：尖沙咀麼地道69號帝苑酒店B2層</span></p><p id=